Correlation & $\displaystyle r=S_{XY}/(S_XS_Y)$\\
MSE & $\displaystyle \Var(\hat\theta)+\Bias(\hat\theta)^2$\\
Consistency & $\displaystyle \hat\theta_n\xrightarrow{p}\theta$\\
Known-$\sigma$ CI & $\displaystyle \bar X\pm z_{\alpha/2}\sigma/\sqrt n$\\
Unknown-$\sigma$ CI & $\displaystyle \bar X\pm t_{\alpha/2,n-1}S/\sqrt n$\\
ECDF & $\displaystyle \hat F_n(x)=n^{-1}\sum I(X_i\le x)$\\
KDE & $\displaystyle \hat f_h(x)=\frac1{nh}\sum K((x-X_i)/h)$\\
